7. Hallym University marks, and the characters Haram and Hari
-------------------------------------------------------------

The Hallym University symbol (the title bar's logo, the application icon, the
installer's side band), the university's characters Haram (하람) and Hari
(하리), and the opening aerial shot of its promotional video (0:00.1 to
0:02.6), slowed down and without sound (the first screen), belong to Hallym
University.  The video is "[Official Video] 한림대학교 홍보영상｜The New Hallym
대학의 내일을 열다", from Hallym University's official YouTube channel,
@HALLYMNEWS.  They are the Hallym MIPS Simulator's (v2.7.1), as they are.

They appear in this software only to identify it as a teaching tool for
Hallym University's courses.

They are not covered by any license in this file, and they may not be taken
from this repository or from the program and used separately.  Anyone who
forks or redistributes this project must remove them, unless Hallym University
has given its own permission.

Where they are:
  electron/src/renderer/assets/hallym/   marks, characters and the video (README.md there)
  electron/packaging/icons/              the application icon, made from the symbol
  electron/packaging/*.bmp               the installer's side band, with the symbol
